        <mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Jira Publication and Recovery&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Publication is user-approved; no direct delete-on-source-replacement.&lt;br/&gt;Preflight before every CREATE. Never mark complete before saving and verifying the Jira key.&lt;br/&gt;Actual remote write/retry behavior is not proven by the read-only connector checks." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FAFAFA;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;fontColor=#334155;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
